[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Travis..."
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "Forgive your big brother,"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "who was too much of a shitebag "
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "to thank you face to face."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "You're the big brother? "
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "How do you know I didn't pop out first?"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "You're prob'ly spoutin off about which "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "one of us popped out first."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Point is, there's no honor in getting"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "rescued by my younger, baby brother."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "So, I took it upon myself to proper"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "kill Scott Gardner, Greg Cantrell, "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "and Massimo Bellini."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "You've got to be kidding me!"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "Would you fucking people stop "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "stealing my kills?! "
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "So now you're officially "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "ranked 5th."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "And no need to thank me. This makes us even,"
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "as far as the rescue goes."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "You and I still have a score "
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "to box off,"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "but that's another subject entirely."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "So don't get yourself killed, 'til "
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "we have the chance to finish our fight."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Damn it... Irish ass... "
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "He could at least've told me "
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "more about those assassins."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "And in case you were wondering..."
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "I took pictures of the three "
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "skangers as souvenirs."
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "How long is this message?!"
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "You'll just have to drool over"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "'em, 'cause there's no way "
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "...you can play through these fights. "
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "The game's stuffed full as it is. "
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "Pics came out nice though."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "They'd prob'ly make good wallpaper "
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "for your cell."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "...Well I'm out of things to say, "
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "so I'll hang up now."
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "text": "Hm. Long message, isn't it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "text": "Travis."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "text": "It's me."
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "text": "I've arranged the next fight."
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "text": "Come to my office?"
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "text": "Gotcha!"
  }
]